            "notes": "This is when the build takes off. Take Zip Grease here - even if I can afford nothing else. Now you can reliably hit direct shots from your backline or surprise angles that they'll never see coming. If no direct shots are open, bounce shots go astonishingly far too.\n\nI usually take Bingo! here to complement Bango!, although if you are already very mobile and not feeling pressured for cooldowns, you could take Hop Boom now to unlock the final skill rotation (2+2+1).\n\nI hope to hit 16k in round 2 so I can also afford Talon, but aim to maximixe weapon damage, armor, and aspd (in that order).",
