            "notes": "2 Frag 2 Furious doubles down on your zip grease - although not quite as accurate, it hits surprisingly often (and with as much weapon damage as you have at this point, even bounce shots are a huge problem for the enemy).\n\nSometimes Rip Roll can help, if an Ashe or Solider is keeping you pinned down. Alternately, sometimes Big Bang can help if you can't land directs - either due to aim issues, or maybe you have to shoot around a DVA, Genji, or Orisa with deflect.\n\nWeapon damage isn't that helpful over 80% as at this point direct hits should 1-shot squishies, so pivot to CDR beyond that. Phantasmic flux enables lifesteal which can help this late in the game, although I don't tend to pick it earlier.",
